sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Proposer
    participant A as Validator A
    participant B as Validator B
    participant L as First-Claim Lock
    participant E as Evidence Log
    P->>A: Capsule C1(predecessor P, root S1)
    P->>B: Capsule C2(predecessor P, root S2)
    A->>L: lock(P)=C1
    A-->>P: WitnessReceipt(C1, ACCEPT)
    B->>L: competing claim C2
    L-->>B: lock conflict
    B->>E: ConflictEvidence(C1,C2)
    E-->>P: auditable conflict artifact
